          "items": [
            "HOME HIGHLIGHTS:<br>- Gulf views<br>- 6-Passenger Low-Speed Vehicle <br>- Private pool and sitting spa* Pool heating is available from October 1st through May 1st for an additional fee of $100 per day.<br>- Elevator<br>- Outdoor fireplace<br>- 6 adult bikes<br>- 2 Laundry rooms<br>- Carriage house<br>- Complete Clean Linen Participant - ALL linens, including comforter covers, are laundered upon every checkout<br><br>DETAILS: Paradise awaits at Pompano Palms, a beautiful Inlet Beach Main Houseâ€”and Carriage Houseâ€”collectively sleeping up to 17 guests. Boasting 6 bedrooms, 6 bathrooms, 2 half bathrooms, and exceptional outdoor spaces, this home is a perfect beach haven for making memories with friends and family.<br><br>Appointed with all the hallmarks of opulent coastal living, this gated property welcomes guests into an idyllic courtyard with a swimming pool, sitting spa, grill, luxurious lanai, and outdoor fireplace. Designed for seamless indoor-outdoor living, a foldable glass wall connects the pool deck to the Main Houseâ€™s first-floor kitchen. Meander inside for snacks and a drink at the 6-stool breakfast bar. The adjacent living area is perfect for relaxing with a comfy sectional, armchairs, and Smart TV. This level includes 1 guest bedroom with a king bedâ€”each bedroom on the property enjoys a private bathroom.<br><br>Take the in-home elevator to the second floor, where timber beams and dramatic light fixtures create a lavish gathering space. The ornate kitchenâ€™s Bertazzoni stove and marble countertops are a chefâ€™s dream. Serve dinner at the grand 10-person dining table, with 5 additional seats at the breakfast bar. Off the sumptuous living space, a beautifully furnished balcony beckons guests to share a pitcher of sangria as the sun sets. At eveningâ€™s end, retire to the guest bedroom with a king bed on this level.<br><br>The top floor hosts a gorgeous primary bedroom and a guest bedroom, both with a king bed and porch, as well as a bunk room with 1 twin-over-twin bed and 1 twin-over-full bed.<br><br>On the fourth level, curl up on the plush bed swing or patio sectional to enjoy the sparkling turquoise water view while indulging in a nightcap from the wet bar.<br><br>In the Carriage House, guests will find a lovely kitchen, living space, balcony, and a guest bedroom with 1 king bed and 1 twin-over-twin bunk bed.<br><br>Experience an extravagant Inlet Beach getaway at Pompano Palms. Parking for 4 vehicles in the driveway, a 6-passenger Low-Speed Vehicle, and 6 complimentary adult bikes makes it easy to explore. Beach access is a 2-minute walk away at the end of Wall Street. Book today!<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS (SLEEPS 17):<br>FIRST FLOOR:<br>-Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br><br>SECOND FLOOR:<br>-Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower/Tub Separate<br><br>THIRD FLOOR:<br>-Primary Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower/Tub Separate<br>-Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br>-Guest Bedroom: Twin-over-Twin and Twin-over-Full Bunk Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br><br>FOURTH FLOOR:<br>-Patio with Gulf views<br><br>CARRIAGE HOUSE:<br>-Guest Bedroom: King Bed and Twin-over-Twin Bunk Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br><br>*Indoor fireplaces are not for guest use.<br><br>*Central air vacuum is not for guest use.<br><br>*Please note that there is construction in the area.",
