            "id": "ac701ce4-cbec-432f-9881-eced9c781c29",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "We are delighted you found Pompano Palms to be the perfect home for your large family and that the 360 Blue was quick to respond and helpful when needed. We will look forward to welcoming you back! Thank you for being our guest.",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Home perfect for large family; outdoor área with pool, fire place was perfect; service from the rental company tended to our every need quickly; amenities in home were well thought out…trash bags, d/w det, etc…Easy bike ride to tennis, coffee, shops, etc…WILL return to this home.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Kristin P.",
        "date": "2025-01-05T13:35:10Z",
        "id": "677a98ef311bf20bd4cb7a82",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Jan 20, 2025",
            "id": "a5a08d74-6323-44a2-8c44-dbfcda214e0f",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Hi, Kristin. We appreciate your 5-star review of Pompano Palms and are pleased that the beauty of the home and its location helped make for an awesome stay. It was our pleasure to host you, and we hope to welcome you back to the beach soon!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "This home was so beautiful and the location was fantastic. We paid ahead to heat the pool and it was heated when get got there. I would absolutely stay here again. No complaints, the only thing we never found were beach towels. Beds were comfortable and the sunsets were so pretty from all of the back decks. The kitchen had enough to cook but wish it had been a little more stocked with cooking utensils, again it had the basics and was just fine. I hope to stay here again, it was awesome",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Gorgeous property and excellent location",
        "verified": true
      }
